{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Melilot was bringing fresh veggies to her grandpa like usual that day, when the sky suddenly got ripped open by a huge hand! As it started spewing forth hordes of creepy abominations, she happened upon a magic star gun that seemed to work wonders against them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's up to her to save bunny land now!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the vast interconnected lands of bunnies and their neighbours, deep down the earth and up in the clouds. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet many cute friends and many horrifying foes in scenes full of silly humor. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your weapon to propel yourself and navigate through platforming challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gain new skills to power your gun and blast through your foes with style and glitters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679240/extras/Melilot_the_angry_bunny.gif?t=1746005704\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No bunnies were harmed in the making of this game. They might get a little scared by all the eldritch stuff going on but they're all gonna be fine. </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3679240?t=1746005704","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679240/7ce8c51e526392b95042e1128660563996499529/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746005704","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679240/a5aad78ca60166fcb815aa8bd76363695bddd76f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746005704","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679240/a5aad78ca60166fcb815aa8bd76363695bddd76f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746005704","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Melilot was bringing fresh veggies to her grandpa like usual that day, when the sky suddenly got ripped open by a huge hand! As it started spewing forth hordes of creepy abominations, she happened upon a magic star gun that seemed to work wonders against them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's up to her to save bunny land now!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the vast interconnected lands of bunnies and their neighbours, deep down the earth and up in the clouds. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet many cute friends and many horrifying foes in scenes full of silly humor. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your weapon to propel yourself and navigate through platforming challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gain new skills to power your gun and blast through your foes with style and glitters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679240/extras/Melilot_the_angry_bunny.gif?t=1746005704\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No bunnies were harmed in the making of this game. They might get a little scared by all the eldritch stuff going on but they're all gonna be fine. </p></li></ul>","developers":["Madamusing Games","Angler Panache"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3679240/8bced315772cf74ab8e5dab1c04007cac5cfb9db/header.jpg?t=1746005704","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257130291,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257130291/movie480.mp4?t=1745571510","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257130291/movie_max.mp4?t=174557